{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":47,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":47,"text":"  the fix is not 'narrow the lock', it is 'keep the guarantee without the wait'","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":48,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":48,"text":"  one per-key in-flight marker gives both: upstream still sees 1, and","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":49,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":49,"text":"  threads on OTHER keys are not serialised behind this one","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":50,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":50,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":51,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":51,"text":"control - the same two designs at a concurrency of one","end":"\n"}
