{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":67,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":67,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":68,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":68,"text":"what raising a thread pool can move","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":69,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":69,"text":"  work bounded by CPU          yes, up to the core count","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":70,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":70,"text":"  work bounded by waiting      yes, that is what pools are for","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":71,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":71,"text":"  work inside one mutex        no, at any pool size","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":72,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":72,"text":"  the refresh path was the third kind and the pool was raised twice","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":73,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":73,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":74,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":74,"text":"one over the critical section is a ceiling, and a ceiling does not care how","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":75,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":75,"text":"many threads are underneath it","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":76,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":76,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":77,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":77,"text":"Holding the lock across the whole refresh is what makes upstream see one","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":78,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":78,"text":"request per key instead of 32, and it is the only scope that gives that","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":79,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":79,"text":"guarantee. It also puts a 40 ms network call inside a mutex, which fixes","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":80,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":80,"text":"throughput at 24/s. The pool went from 8 to 32 and then to 512, and the","end":"\n"}
